	(text "C_CPO recommended as ~10x capacitance of MOSFET.\nUsing SQS460EN (C_iss 603 pF typ / 755 pF max, NASA GSFC SEE-tested),\nC_CPO = 10nF (about 13x C_iss max)\n\nC_VCC is required as 0.1uF from datasheet.\n\nC_V_OUT is determined by ΔV ≈ I × t_ON / C_V_OUT (voltage droop)\n& ΔV ≈ I × √(L ÷ C_V_OUT) (Stopping voltage spike from stray inductance)\nDatasheet recommends C_V_OUT = 10uF enough to counter these effects."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 245.11 56.896 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "2cf3db0e-19f0-445c-bfd4-98631ca6ebed")
	)
	(text "IDEAL DIODE USING LTC4353\nDataSheet: https://www.analog.com/media/en/technical-documentation/data-sheets/4353f.pdf\nLTC4353I Operating Range:\n−40°C to 85°C"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 202.184 21.336 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "2dbf1d3f-4cf5-40e5-8838-a66c4731a895")
	)
	(text "R_NTC at 10k Ohms matches the resistance from the NTC at 25 Celcius\n\nNTC: NASA GSFC S-311-P-18 qualified 10 kΩ thermistor (YSI/TE 44907, β = 3574 K), leaded, bonded to the cells"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 81.788 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "46663f6f-13ea-4a8b-9133-4f47a00aee66")
	)
	(text "RESISTOR VALUE RATIONALE - R_Set (FPF2700 current limit)\nFPF2700 eq. 1: R_SET [kΩ] = 277.5 / I_LIM [A]. 549 kΩ gives I_LIM = 0.51 A typ / 0.40 A min, the\ndatasheet's characterized point at the lowest supported limit (0.4 - 2 A range).\nCaps each heater channel at ≈ 0.5 A. E96 value kept on purpose: it is the datasheet table\nvalue, and the datasheet calls for a 1 % (or better) R_SET."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.274 155.956 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "744e1f8e-4289-4431-8643-f244b1c3b08b")
	)
